# Google Places API Configuration
# 
# To get your Google Places API key:
# 1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com/
# 2. Create a new project or select an existing one
# 3. Enable the "Places API" (New) or "Places API"
# 4. Go to "Credentials" and create an API key
# 5. Restrict the API key to only the Places API for security
#
# To find your Google Place ID:
# 1. Go to https://www.google.com/maps
# 2. Search for your business
# 3. Click on your business listing
# 4. The Place ID is in the URL (look for "place_id=" parameter)
#    Or use Google's Place ID Finder: https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/places/web-service/place-id

GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=your_google_places_api_key_here
GOOGLE_PLACE_ID=your_google_place_id_here
